# da Silva (last, corresponding/contact).
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "KubeSBS: a reproducible measurement framework for Kubernetes cluster simulators"
abstract: >-
  KubeSBS (formerly k8s-sims) orchestrates and benchmarks Kubernetes scheduler simulators
  (kwok, OpenSimulator, kube-scheduler-simulator, SimKube, Kubemark, K8sSim/Volcano,
  and the pfn k8s-cluster-simulator) over Alibaba, Google Borg, and Azure cluster
  traces, reporting CPU, memory, run time, and scheduling outcomes. Developed by
  the GCDA group as the experimental artifact of a survey on Kubernetes
  simulation tools.
type: software
